ove it so that a tool held by it appears to be hanging up.\\n\\nAlso locks the armor stand and disables all slots except the mainhand."}},"text":"Tool rack"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n\\n       "},{"color":"dark_blue","text":"Swap Slots"},{"color":"white","text":"     "},{"color":"dark_purple","hoverEvent":{"action":"show_text","contents":{"color":"yellow","text":"Swap items between equipment slots"}},"text":"Ⓘ"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n\\n."},{"color":"black","text":"Mainhand "},{"color":"dark_green","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger as_trigger set 161"},"text":"<->"},{"color":"black","text":" Offhand"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n  "},{"color":"black","text":"Mainhand "},{"color":"dark_green","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger as_trigger set 162"},"text":"<->"},{"color":"black","text":" Head"}],"text":""}',
								'{"extra":[{"color":"light_purple","clickEvent":{"action":"change_page","value":"1"},"text":"«"},{"color":"white","text":"."},{"color":"dark_blue","text":"Pose Mirror & Flip"},{"color":"white","text":" "},{"color":"dark_purple","hoverEvent":{"action":"show_text","contents":{"color":"yellow","text":"Mirroring copies the arm or leg pose from left to right or vice versa. Flipping reverses the armor stand\'s pose entirely."}},"text":"Ⓘ"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n\\n "},{"color":"black","text":"Mirror Arms"},{"color":"white","text":"  "},{"color":"dark_green","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger as_trigger set 131"},"text":"L>R"},{"color":"white","text":"  "},{"color":"dark_green","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger as_trigger set 132"},"text":"R>L"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n          "},{"color":"black","text":"Legs"},{"color":"white","text":"  "},{"color":"dark_green","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger as_trigger set 133"},"text":"L>R"},{"color":"white","text":"  "},{"color":"dark_green","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger as_trigger set 134"},"text":"R>L"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n\\n                  ."},{"color":"dark_green","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger as_trigger set 135"},"text":"<-Flip->"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n\\n         "},{"color":"dark_blue","text":"Utilities"},{"color":"white","text":"        "},{"color":"dark_purple","hoverEvent":{"action":"show_text","contents":{"color":"yellow","text":"Copying an armor stand stores it\'s settings and pose in the book and these can then be pasted into another armor stand. The book must be the selected item in your mainhand or offhand for this to work.\\n\\nLocking an armor stand prevents it from being changed using the book and disables interaction with the equipment slots.\\n\\nSealing an armor stand, which is only available in creative mode, does the same and in addition makes it invulnerable"}},"text":"Ⓘ"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n\\n     ."},{"color":"dark_green","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger as_trigger set 1004"},"text":"Copy"},{"color":"black","text":" / "},{"color":"red","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger as_trigger set 1005"},"text":"Paste"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n\\n     "},{"color":"dark_green","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger as_trigger set 1000"},"text":"Lock"},{"color":"black","text":" / "},{"color":"red","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger as_trigger set 1001"},"text":"Unlock"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n\\n     "},{"color":"dark_green","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/function armor_statues:sealing/seal"},"text":"Seal"},{"color":"black","text":" / "},{"color":"red","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/function armor_statues:sealing/unseal"},"text":"Unseal"}],"text":""}',
								'{"extra":[{"color":"light_purple","clickEvent":{"action":"change_page","value":"1"},"text":"«"},{"color":"white","text":"    "},{"color":"dark_blue","text":"Item Frames"},{"color":"white","text":"     "},{"color":"dark_purple","hoverEvent":{"action":"show_text","contents":{"color":"yellow","text":"To make an item frame invisible it must be one block in front of the players eyes and have an item in the frame.\\nAlternatively you can also enter:\\n/trigger if_invisible\\nTo make the item frame visible remove its item.\\n\\nMust be in creative to make item frame Fixed, or have it enabled from the admin menu."}},"text":"Ⓘ"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n\\n"},{"color":"dark_green","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger if_invisible set 1"},"text":"Invisible item frame"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n\\n"},{"color":"black","text":"Fixed Item Frame:"},{"color":"white","text":"\\n        "},{"color":"dark_green","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger if_invisible set 2"},"text":"Yes"},{"color":"black","text":" / "},{"color":"red","clickEvent":{"action":"run_command","value":"/trigger if_invisible set 3"},"text":"No"},{"color":"white","text":""}],"text":""}',
